<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60372" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτη-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτάομαι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that may be gotten</i> or
				<i>acquired</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληϊστοὶ μὲν . . βόες . . , κτητοὶ δὲ
					τρίποδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.407
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1295
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				324a
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>worth getting, desirable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				197d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hp.Mi.</u>
				374e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>acquired, gained</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				841e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτητή</span>
			<i>female slave</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμετή</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				406
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μέρος οἰκίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					3.1164
				</span></i>
			 (<i>f</i>).<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
